  "body": "To be sold by Deadline 28/05/2026 Thursday at 4:00 pm (Unless Sold Prior) \r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a 1.26ha development site in the highly sought-after coastal suburb of Red Beach on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula.\r\n\r\nPositioned within a quiet, established cul-de-sac surrounded by quality homes, the 12,600m² landholding has Resource Consent (RC) approved for a 9-lot residential subdivision, offering a well-positioned development opportunity in a prestigious and desirable neighbourhood known for its high-quality residential environment.\r\n\r\nThe subdivision features generous section sizes ranging from 860m² to 2,280m², ideal for premium homes within the Residential Large Lot Zone. Town water and wastewater services are available at the street, supporting efficient development.\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from the amenities of Silverdale and Orewa, along with convenient motorway access to Auckland, the site offers an attractive balance of coastal lifestyle, convenience, and strong residential demand.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights\r\n\r\n* 1.26ha (12,600m²) landholding\r\n* RC approved for 9 residential lots\r\n* Section sizes 860m² - 2,280m²\r\n* Residential Large Lot Zone\r\n* Located in a high-quality, well-established neighbourhood\r\n* Town water and wastewater connections available\r\n\r\nApproved Subdivision Details\r\n\r\n* Lot 1: 1,000m² land - 220m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 2: 860m² land - 220m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 3: 2,100m² land - 300m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 4: 1,080m² land - 240m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 5: 1,530m² land - 190m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 6: 1,290m² land - 175m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 7: 1,120m² land - 370m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 8: 1,230m² land - 220m² proposed building \r\n* Lot 9: 2,280m² land - 300m² proposed building \r\n\r\nAll conjunctional agents  welcome.",
